    "title": "Giants star Jaxson Dart has date night with Marissa Ayers amid Alix Earle rumors",
    "text": "Despite rumors of sliding into newly single Alix Earle’s DMs, Giants QB Jaxson Dart is very much in the game with influencer Marissa Ayers.\nA fellow diner tells us they spotted the couple having a cozy date night at upscale Italian joint Ristorante MV in Bernardsville, NJ, on Monday.\n“They looked totally into each other,” says the spy. “They were with two other friends.”\nLater they headed to the bar to finish watching “Monday Night Football” as the Los Angeles Chargers took on the Philadelphia Eagles.\nAyers was also spotted in Foxborough, Mass., last week during Big Blue’s loss to the Patriots, standing with Dart’s mom Kara on the field at Gillette Stadium.\nThis week, Dart’s name got dragged into “Dancing with the Stars” hoofer Earle’s split from Texans return specialist Braxton Berrios — when a fake DM went viral.\nEarle addressed the buzz on TikTok on Sunday after a screenshot of a fake Instagram message from Dart to Earle surfaced saying, “hey, u single now?” — causing an internet uproar.\n“What is this fake photoshopped dm u guys are posting? 1. That never happened. 2. That wouldn’t be on my story,” Earle wrote in text over an image that showed part of her face.\nA source confirmed to Page Six last weekend that Earle and Berrios had called it quits after two years of dating, telling us the split was mutual and “distance induced.”\nEarle was living it up in Miami over the weekend during Art Basel.\nShe was spotted with gal pals at the pool of the 1 Hotel in South Beach and attended Nylon’s blow outbash with Ellie Goulding.\nShe also hosted an event for her brand SipMARGS on a superyacht with DJ Carlita.",
